{"severity":"error","file":"errors/codec_missing_1.march","start_line":20,"start_col":12,"end_line":20,"end_col":57,"message":"`Node.send` needs a JSON codec for `Ping`, and none is derived.\nA remote message crosses the network as JSON, and its type's name is its wire tag; a receiver decodes it with `from_json`.","code":"codec_missing","fix":{"kind":"insert","after_line":15,"text":"  derive Json for Ping","applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[],"notes":["Add `derive Json for Ping` next to its declaration."],"category":"ACTOR"}
